  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/CoffeeDelight.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"148\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>歡迎來到咖啡樂園！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這是農夫樂活的一個附加模組！它將咖啡豆帶入了Minecraft！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">想泡杯咖啡？先在沙漠中找幾棵咖啡樹吧。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">採集咖啡果實、烘烤咖啡豆，再將其磨成咖啡粉。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">現在，準備好壺和杯子來煮咖啡吧！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/CuccumelaPot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"813\" height=\"172\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/MokaPot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"812\" height=\"172\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/TurkeyPot.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"812\" height=\"172\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/MakeCup.png\" width=\"546\" height=\"170\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">咖啡壺做好後，放在熱源上加熱，放入咖啡粉，等待咖啡煮好，再用杯子盛裝！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">小心！煮太久咖啡會變糊！我們可不喜歡喝杯燒焦的咖啡，對吧？ :(</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">別擔心！聰明先生來幫您！使用聰明先生能更快更好地製作黑咖啡！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/MakeCoffeeByMrClever.png\" width=\"817\" height=\"173\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">用黑咖啡來製作更多飲品！品嚐所有咖啡吧！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">試著自己做出更多咖啡，盡情享受品嚐咖啡的樂趣！祝您玩得開心 :)</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/AllItem.png\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AmarokIce/CoffeeDelight/master/img/Breakfast.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
